AmigaOS: libfilezilla on our own libraries. TLS on GFOpenTLS (gfopentls.library),
hashes, encryption and signatures on GFOpenCrypto (gfopencrypto.library), in
place of GnuTLS and Nettle. A client only (FileZilla FTPS); certificate
making, client certificates, PKCS#11 and JWS answer "not supported".
